at  if you're telling me that this is a new  thing for entrepreneurs and it's really  amazing and you've been a lower part of  my community and I go check it out it's  got a deliverer right if it's not good  I'm not gonna talk about it right but if  it's great and I use it and I think it  could help other people then I will help  spread that message for you so that's my  three-step ninja process it's helped me  over and over and over and over again  and hope that it helps you to believe  those are you watching I'd love to hear  how you've connected with influencers  what strategies you've used to get your  name out there leave a comment below I'm  gonna join in the discussion and  hopefully will help inspire other  entrepreneurs as well and if you like  this video you want to see more don't  forget to subscribe to the channel and  the newsletter thank you so much for  watching I'll see you soon

